  "scope": "Execute (Unicorn, original LOLG.DAT bytes) the damage-request producers of Dawn spells 7 and 58 and pin every request\nthey send to a target's virtual+0x80 receiver, in the field naming of tools/verify_hive_spark_request.py\n(mask word0, signature word2, target +4, owner +8, projectile +16, mode +20, subtype +21, amount +22).\n\n- Spell 7 hop child (vtable 0x6774, Spark class built by 0x10A0E8 at each chain hop):\n  - slot +0xFC 0x10A1D8 = stored-target request (needs projectile+0x42);\n  - slot +0x100 0x10A28C = contact request(s) to a touched object.\n- Spell 58 (Plasma, vtable 0x7860) hit routine 0x105A40(projectile, target): one-shot (latch +0x5E), keyed by the impact\n  state +0x58 that the flight selector maps to (inline tables at 0x105620 / 0x10592C).\n\nBoundaries:\n- memset 0x14F8A4 is bridged;\n- the audio cue E3924 is disabled through byte 0x269C4 bit0, as the Spark verifier does;\n- the touched object's virtual+0 call in 0x10A28C returns a supplied type;\n- execution stops at each receiver call, so damage handling after the receiver is not executed.\n",
